 |  809_dry_cracked_earth_albedo  |  \n|  ![⟨88⟩]  |  809_dry_cracked_earth_albedo  |  \n|  ![⟨89⟩]  |  809_dry_cracked_earth_albedo  |  \n|  ![⟨90⟩]  |  809_dry_cracked_earth_albedo  |  \n|  ![⟨91⟩]  |  809_dry_cracked_earth_albedo  |  \n|  ![⟨92⟩]  |  809_dry_cracked_earth_albedo  |  \n|  ![⟨93⟩]  |  910_pink_rocky_dirt_albedo  |  \n|  ![⟨94⟩]  |  910_pink_rocky_dirt_albedo  |  \n|  ![⟨95⟩]  |  910_pink_rocky_dirt_albedo  |  \n|  ![⟨96⟩]  |  910_pink_rocky_dirt_albedo  |  \n|  ![⟨97⟩]  |  910_pink_rocky_dirt_albedo  |  \n|  ![⟨98⟩]  |  910_pink_rocky_dirt_albedo  |  \n  * Pipeline⟨99⟩\n  * Previews⟨100⟩\n  * Godot 4 import⟨101⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨102⟩ PBR Materials (MonoRelief V2 core) \nAuto-generated PBR material set (10 materials). Each subfolder contains a complete PBR set:  \n| Map  | File  | Format  |  \n| --- | --- | --- |  \n| Albedo  | `*_albedo.png`  | 8-bit RGB  |  \n| Height  | `*_height.png`  | 16-bit grayscale  |  \n| Normal  | `*_normal.png`  | 8-bit RGB (OpenGL, Godot 4)  |  \n| Roughness  | `*_roughness.png`  | 8-bit grayscale  |  \n| Metallic  | `*_metallic.png`  | 8-bit grayscale  |  \n##   ⟨99⟩ Pipeline \nGenerated using MonoRelief V2 (Fig. 7), Marigold-only variant:\n  1. Base depth — **Marigold Depth** v1.0\n  2. Normals — **Marigold Normals** v0.1\n  3. Scharr-from-depth + Marigold normals → geometric fusion\n  4. BiNI (Bilateral Normal Integration) → refined depth\n  5. Frequency blend (Marigold Depth low-freq + BiNI high-freq, edge-suppressed)\n  6. PBR maps derived: height from final depth; roughness + metallic from heuristics\n\n\n##   ⟨100⟩ Previews   \n| Material  | Preview  |  \n| --- | --- |  \n| `01_cracked_purple_rock_albedo`  | ![01_cracked_purple_rock_albedo](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Zakhar1746/pbr-materials_V2/resolve/main/01_cracked_purple_rock_albedo/01_cracked_purple_rock_albedo_preview.png)⟨103⟩  |  \n| `02_dry_brown_soil_purple_patches_albedo`  | ![02_dry_brown_soil_purple_patches_albedo](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Zakhar1746/pbr-materials_V2/resolve/main/02_dry_brown_soil_purple_patches_albedo/02_dry_brown_soil_purple_patches_albedo_preview.png)⟨104⟩  |  \n| `03_wet_alien_swamp_albedo`  | ![03_wet_alien_swamp_albedo](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Zakhar1746/pbr-materials_V2/resolve/main/03_wet_alien_swamp_albedo/03_wet_alien_swamp_albedo_preview.png)⟨105⟩  |  \n| `04_purple_pools_rock_albedo`  | ![04_purple_pools_rock_albedo](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Zakhar1746/pbr-materials_V2/resolve/main/04_purple_pools_rock_albedo/04_purple_pools_rock_albedo_preview.png)⟨106⟩  |  \n| `05_blue_biolum_soil_albedo`  | ![05_blue_biolum_soil_albedo](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Zakhar1746/pbr-materials_V2/resolve/main/05_blue_biolum_soil_albedo/05_blue_biolum_soil_albedo_preview.png)⟨107⟩  |  \n| `06_purple_leaf_carpet_albedo`  | ![06_purple_leaf_carpet_albedo](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Zakhar1746/pbr-materials_V2/resolve/main/06_purple_leaf_carpet_albedo/06_purple_leaf_carpet_albedo_preview.png)⟨108⟩  |  \n| `07_black_gravel_albedo`  | ![07_black_gravel_albedo](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Zakhar1746/pbr-materials_V2/resolve/main/07_black_gravel_albedo/07_black_gravel_albedo_preview.png)⟨109⟩  |  \n| `08_moss_sparse_plants_albedo`  | ![08_moss_sparse_plants_albedo](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Zakhar1746/pbr-materials_V2/resolve/main/08_moss_sparse_plants_albedo/08_moss_sparse_plants_albedo_preview.png)⟨110⟩  |  \n| `09_dry_cracked_earth_albedo`  | ![09_dry_cracked_earth_albedo](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Zakhar1746/pbr-materials_V2/resolve/main/09_dry_cracked_earth_albedo/09_dry_cracked_earth_albedo_preview.png)⟨111⟩  |  \n| `10_pink_rocky_dirt_albedo`  | ![10_pink_rocky_dirt_albedo](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Zakhar1746/pbr-materials_V2/resolve/main/10_pink_rocky_dirt_albedo/10_pink_rocky_dirt_albedo_preview.png)⟨112⟩  |  \n##   ⟨101⟩ Godot 4 import \n  1. Create `StandardMaterial3D`.\n  2. Set **Albedo → Texture** to `*_albedo.png`.\n  3. Set **Normal Map → Texture** to `*_normal.png` (enable `Normal Map` toggle).\n  4. Set **Roughness → Texture** to `*_roughness.png` (Mode = R).\n  5. Set **Metallic → Texture** to `*_metallic.png` (Mode = R).\n  6. Optional: **Depth → Texture** = `*_height.png` for parallax/displacement.\n\n\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    132\nNumber of rows: 60 Total file size: 84.9 MB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨113⟩ Privacy⟨114⟩ About⟨115⟩ Careers⟨116⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
